{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜韓歆毅：AI醫療僅屬輔助 臨床決定須由醫生把關 螞蟻阿福用戶1.5億           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">螞蟻集團行政總裁韓歆毅表示，人工智能應用於醫療始終只屬輔助工具，臨床決策必須交由專業醫生負責，模型能力愈強，人的專業價值反而愈顯著。他指出，AI可充當具溯源功能的臨床資料庫，讓醫生的判斷建基於更完整證據。同場公布的數據顯示，螞蟻阿福累計用戶達1.5億，九個月內增長約五成，每日網上問診次數超過2,000萬次。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T21:04:19.140051+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:30:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T20:57:56.725485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T20:57:56.725485+00:00","content_hash":"e9859c43ea5c0444dc2b31aa6d257c535fb22d84e7f14f0982a392c70408b6c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}